Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.2.77-rt110 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.2.77 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.2-rt
  Head SHA1: 5acce3131c60b7a37b9d21819db1b968bbf3a3a6


Or to build 3.2.77-rt110 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.2.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.2.77.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.2/patch-3.2.77-rt110.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve

